We checked the zstd repo on GitHub https://github.com/facebook/zstd . The COPYING file contains there the text of the GPL-2.0 and the LICENSE file contains the text of an individualized BSD-3-Clause license. The files contain no "or at your option any later version" for GPL-2.0. Thus we concluded BSD-3-Clasue OR GPL-2.0-only as license of this file, in contrast to the statement above which states:
