Simple square root algorithm. This is from:
http://stackoverflow.com/questions/1623375/writing-your-own-square-root-function
Written by Chihung Yu
Creative Commons license
http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/legalcode
It has been modified to compile correctly, and for U-Boot style.
We checked the stackoverflow site. Subscriber content (which is the square root calculation is licensed under CC-BY-SA-4.0 see https://stackoverflow.com/legal/terms-of-service#copyright
Thus we concluded additionally CC-BY-SA-4.0 as license of this file. This makes the license situation of this file incompatible.
The information  was retrieved on 10th of Nov 2023 AND NOASSERTION </text>
